# JVM crash artefacts. Gradle drops these next to the project on an OOM
# (one 851 MB heap dump already got committed and bounced off GitHub's
# 100 MB limit). They are pure build debris and never belong in history.
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Local databases and build caches
*.db
*.db-journal
/android/build/

